### COMPLIANCE REQUIREMENTS
- **HIPAA**: All PHI handled by Jane, never on website
- **NY Mental Health Regulations**: Office of Mental Health (OMH) for therapy; NYSED for wellness
- **TCPA (April 2025)**: 
  - Prior Express Written Consent for marketing SMS
  - Opt out honored within 10 days
  - Max 1x/day, 3x/week for automated messages
- **Good Faith Estimate**: Notice required on booking/pricing pages
- **ADA/WCAG 2.1 AA**: Accessibility statement required

