### FORBIDDEN
- **"Spa" or "Medspa" language** (Client directive — remove ALL instances)
- Presenting Wisdom and Wellness as separate/side by side paths
- Insurance listed only under Wisdom (it applies to both)
- Collecting ANY PHI on the website
- Building custom booking/calendar system (use Jane only)
- Building telehealth functionality (use Jane's built in)
- Building billing/payment processing (Jane handles)
- Aggressive urgency messaging (trauma informed design)
- Time pressure tactics
- Pre checked consent boxes
- Hyphens in copy (Rocket Creative standard)
- Meta keywords tag (obsolete)
- Colored drop shadows
- Content width exceeding 1440px
